  "question": {
    "text": "In the figure shown, what is the current (in Ampere) drawn from the battery? You are given:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/26255f63-7317-4fb2-a4f1-a3a714fa0511-image11.png\" />",
